uling or changing the title.\",\n    \"parameters\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"event_id\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Unique identifier of the event to be modified.\"\n        },\n        \"new_title\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"The new title for the event. If not provided, the title remains unchanged.\"\n        },\n        \"new_start_date\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"The new start date for the event in the format 'YYYY-MM-DD'. If not provided, the start date remains unchanged.\"\n        },\n        \"new_start_time\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"The new start time for the event in 24-hour format 'HH:MM'. If not provided, the start time remains unchanged.\"\n        },\n        \"new_duration\": {\n          \"type\": \"integer\",\n          \"description\": \"The new duration of the event in minutes. If not provided, the duration remains unchanged.\"\n        },\n        \"new_rrule\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"The new recurrence rule for the event, following the iCalendar RRULE format. If not provided, the recurrence rule remains unchanged.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"event_id\"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n]\n\nRequest: Find the files matching *.csv under /mnt/shared/finance.\n\nReply with only a JSON array of the tool calls that fulfil the request, each of the form {\"name\": \"<tool name>\", \"arguments\": {...}}, where \"arguments\" is a JSON object (not a string). When the request needs several calls, list them all. Reply with [] if no tool fits the request, or if the request does not give a value for a required argument: never guess one. Include every required argument. Include an optional argument only if the request asks for a value for it; otherwise leave it out and the tool applies its default. Give each value the type its schema declares: JSON numbers for integer and number, true or false for boolean, and strings for string, copied exactly as written.","role":"user"},{"content":"[{\"name\":\"searchFiles\",\"arguments\":{\"directory\":\"/mnt/shared/finance\",\"pattern\":\"*.csv\"}}]","role":"assistant"},{"content":"Tool results:\n[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"searchFiles\",\n    \"result\": [\n      {\n        \"path\": \"/mnt/shared/finance/export-20260202.pdf\",\n        \"sizeBytes\": 284423,\n        \"modified\": \"2025-01-15T09:00\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"/mnt/shared/finance/export-20260902.pdf\",\n        \"sizeBytes\": 39758,\n        \"modified\": \"2025-02-12T09:00\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"path\": \"/mnt/shared/finance/report-20250722.csv\",\n        \"sizeBytes\": 784356,\n        \"modified\": \"2025-03-10T09:00\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n]\n\nRequest: Delete the oldest of those for good, don't just move it to the trash.\n\nReply as before: only a JSON array of tool calls, or [] if no tool fits or a required value is missing.","role":"user"},{"content":"[{\"name\":\"deleteFile\",\"arguments\":{\"path\":\"/mnt/shared/finance/export-20260202.pdf\",\"permanent\":true}}]","role":"assistant"},{"content":"Tool results:\n[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"deleteFile\",\n    \"result\": {\n      \"deleted\": \"/mnt/shared/finance/export-20260202.pdf\"\n    }\n  }\n]\n\nRequest: Zip the remaining two into /srv/archive/old-reports.zip.\n\nReply as before: only a JSON array of tool calls, or [] if no tool fits or a required value is missing.","role":"user"},{"content":"[]","role":"assistant"},{"content":"A new tool is now available:\n{\n  \"name\": \"compressFiles\",\n  \"description\": \"Pack a set of files into a single zip archive on the file server and return the archive's path.\",\n  \"parameters\": {\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n      \"paths\": {\n        \"type\": \"array\",\n        \"description\": \"Absolute paths of the fil